====== Thomson SpeedTouch 7G ======
{{media:thomson:st7g:st7g.png?150|}}

This ADSL modem router wifi was originally made by Inventel (blue7G board). 

The router is distributed by some ISPs like the italian ISP [[wp>Fastweb_(telecommunications_company)|Fastweb]]. The label on this unit says : //THOMSON 7G Modem Easy Thomson V1.0//

Other routers using the same board:
  * [[toh:BT:homehub_v1|HOMEHUB v1]]
  * [[https://oldwiki.archive.openwrt.org/toh/inventel/d5213|AOLBox]]

===== Supported Versions =====
Not supported yet. However you can install OpenWrt (no ADSL) using a custom CFE.
| {{:meta:icons:tango:package-x-generic.png?nolink|}} | Bootloader (CFE), OpenWrt prebuilt firmware, and patches to build your own firmware:\\ [[https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&id=0B-EMoBe-_OdBWHkwRGtsU0FhanM|Speedtouch7G-openwrt_12.09_wl-CFE.zip]] |

